  - m_Id: 140582828425331
    m_Localized: .22 Magazine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425332
    m_Localized: A cheap 3D printed 12 round compact .22 magazine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425333
    m_Localized: High Capacity .22 Magazine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425334
    m_Localized: A cheap 3D 24 round compact .22 magazine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425335
    m_Localized: Extended .22 Magazine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425336
    m_Localized: A cheap 3D 48 round compact .22 magazine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425337
    m_Localized: Guardian Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425338
    m_Localized: A sturdy stock compatible with Meridian firearms, designed to improve recoil handling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425339
    m_Localized: Buckler Stock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425340
    m_Localized: A short stock compatible with Meridian firearms, designed to improve recoil control without sacrificing ergonomic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425341
    m_Localized: Metal Ingot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425342
    m_Localized: Chemical Supplies (Common)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425343
    m_Localized: Can be unpacked into items that are useful for basic chemical crafting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425344
    m_Localized: A collection of common chemical supplies you could likely find in the Station Hardware Depot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425345
    m_Localized: Chemical Supplies (Restricted)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425346
    m_Localized: Can be unpacked into items that are useful for advanced chemical crafting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425347
    m_Localized: A collection of restricted chemical supplies needed for crafting narcotics, or explosives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425348
    m_Localized: Medical Supplies (Common)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425349
    m_Localized: A collection of common medical supplies, mostly over-the-counter pharmacy items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425350
    m_Localized: Medical Supplies (Restricted)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425351
    m_Localized: A collection of restricted medical supplies, necessary for the care of the Station's infirm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425352
    m_Localized: Scrap Metal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425353
    m_Localized: Can be smelted into Metal Ore. With limited resources available on the Station, salvage and recycling are important habits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425354
    m_Localized: Junk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425355
    m_Localized: Broken scraps and useless rubbish. Barely recyclable, worth next to nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425356
    m_Localized: Metal Ore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425357
    m_Localized: Rare Metal Ore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425358
    m_Localized: Electronic Parts (Common)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425359
    m_Localized: 'An assortment of all kinds of useful, if common, electronics: connectors, switches, capacitors, processors and processing units...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425360
    m_Localized: Electronic Parts (Rare)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425361
    m_Localized: An assortment of uncommon, high-end electronic parts. A certain inventor would be very interested in this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425362
    m_Localized: Wire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425363
    m_Localized: A bundle of electrical wires. From the looks of it, it was harvested from somewhere...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425364
    m_Localized: 3D Printing Filament
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425365
    m_Localized: 'A spool of premium filament for use in a 3D printer. Made from recycled plastics where possible. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425366
    m_Localized: Gun Parts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425367
    m_Localized: Obtained from disassembling firearm with a screwdriver. Can be used to refurbish used firearms. Repeated attempts will increase refurbish chance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425368
    m_Localized: A collection of internal gun parts, including screws, springs, and other small components.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425369
    m_Localized: Radioactive Waste
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425370
    m_Localized: Radioactive waste material. Handle with care.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425371
    m_Localized: A collection of hazardous nuclear waste. No one wants to deal with this stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425372
    m_Localized: Flux Smelting Agent (Basic)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425373
    m_Localized: A useful additive that improves the purity of Metal Ore when used during smelting. It is consumed in the process.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425374
    m_Localized: Flux Smelting Agent (Advanced)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425375
    m_Localized: 'A useful additive that improves the purity of Metal Ore when used during smelting. Reusable. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425376
    m_Localized: Liberator 3D Printed Pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425377
    m_Localized: A low cost plastic 3D printed pistol.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425378
    m_Localized: Doesn't get cheaper than this. It's good for a few shots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425379
    m_Localized: Nestfire Compact
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425380
    m_Localized: A small open-sourced pistol chambered in .22 SR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425381
    m_Localized: Widely used for home defence in the Lower Level. Mostly tolerated by Security. Probably handmade by a Lower Level gunsmith.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425382
    m_Localized: Ironcraft 10
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425383
    m_Localized: A heavy open-sourced pistol chambered in 10mm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425384
    m_Localized: Capable of piercing body armor. A popular weapon for Lower Level Revolutionary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425385
    m_Localized: Sentinel Mk. III.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425386
    m_Localized: A reliable handgun, chambered in 10mm. Mostly carried by Security
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425387
    m_Localized: Peacemaker Heavy SMG
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425388
    m_Localized: A heavy SMG, chambered in 10mm. Used sparingly by Security during high stakes operations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425389
    m_Localized: Rampart Dual-Action Shotgun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425390
    m_Localized: A dependable and adaptable shotgun built for law enforcement, featuring a dual-action mechanism that ensures reliable performance with a wide range of ammunition types.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425391
    m_Localized: PulseGuard Stun Gun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425392
    m_Localized: A well made self-defence option officially endorsed by Security. Mostly used by Upper Level due to high cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425393
    m_Localized: Lancewell Revolver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425394
    m_Localized: A 5" general purpose Lancewell revolver chambered in .45 AFP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425395
    m_Localized: A simple and highly reliable weapon. Designed to endure extreme conditions, while requiring minimum maintenance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425396
    m_Localized: .22 SR Ammunition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425397
    m_Localized: A handful of .22 SR ammo. While small, it still can be lethal at close range. Most importantly, it is very cheap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425398
    m_Localized: .22 SR Ammunition (AP)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425399
    m_Localized: A handful of .22 SR Armor-Piercing ammo. Capable of piercing body armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425400
    m_Localized: .22 SR Ammunition (Non-Lethal)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425401
    m_Localized: A handful of .22 SR Non-Lethal ammo. Tip with rubber, it is designed to incapacitate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425402
    m_Localized: 10mm Ammunition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425403
    m_Localized: A handful of 10mm ammo. Powerful and reliable, it is the standard round for heavy pistols.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425404
    m_Localized: 10mm Ammunition (AP)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425405
    m_Localized: A handful of high velocity 10mm Armor-Piercing Discarding Sabot (APDS) ammo. Capable of piercing body armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425406
    m_Localized: 10mm Ammunition (Non-Lethal)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425407
    m_Localized: A handful of 10mm Non-Lethal ammo. Tip with rubber, it is designed to incapacitate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425408
    m_Localized: Tazer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425409
    m_Localized: A compact stun weapon used for self-defense and enforcement. Delivers a painful jolt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425410
    m_Localized: Birth Control Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425411
    m_Localized: A contraceptive pill that prevents pregnancy. It's a combination of estrogen and progestin hormones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425412
    m_Localized: Phagimycin Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425413
    m_Localized: A powerful antibiotic made with bacteriophages and fungi to counter antibiotic resistance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425414
    m_Localized: Unlicensed Phagimycin Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425415
    m_Localized: A powerful antibiotic. This one is made illegally without license to the carmicheal's patent in an underground lab.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425416
    m_Localized: Zyanide Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425417
    m_Localized: A fast-acting and deadly chemical compound. Handle with caution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425418
    m_Localized: Phanta Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425419
    m_Localized: An extremely addictive, dangerous and cheap synthetic opioid drug used for treatment of severe pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425420
    m_Localized: More than 50 times stronger than Oxymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425421
    m_Localized: ZeroChew Tab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425422
    m_Localized: A tab of ZeroChew, an affordable appetite suppressant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425423
    m_Localized: Used by some Lower Levels inhabitants looking to stretch their credits by skipping meals. Marketed as Regime-X, a weight loss drug in the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425424
    m_Localized: Smelling Salts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425425
    m_Localized: A thin glass tube containing alcohol and ammonia that helps restore consciousness after fainting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425426
    m_Localized: Blood Bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425427
    m_Localized: A 500ml blood transfusion bag drawn from a universal, though not necessarily willing, donor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425428
    m_Localized: Bag of "Blue Blood"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425429
    m_Localized: An injectable biogel engineered to dissolve arterial plaque and microclots over time. It effectively prevents coronary artery disease, ischemic stroke and hypertension-related complications.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425430
    m_Localized: It's not actually blood. Not so common even in the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425431
    m_Localized: Vial of "Dream Dust"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425432
    m_Localized: A cheap, euphoria inducing powder, created in the Lower Levels. Used as a brief escape from the harsh realities of Station life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425433
    m_Localized: Vial of "Nightmare Dust"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425434
    m_Localized: A fine powder that acts as both a poison and a hallucinogen. Ingestion or inhalation causes severe nausea, weakness, and disorientation, followed terrifying hallucinations. High doses can be lethal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425435
    m_Localized: Caffeine Pill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425436
    m_Localized: Synthesized from the waste of Upper Levels espresso bars, these pills are essential for the long shift workers of the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425437
    m_Localized: Nightingale's Salve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425438
    m_Localized: Made from modified aloe and medical grade honey. This salve has antibacterial properties and promotes cell regeneration and growth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425439
    m_Localized: Rubbing Alcohol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425440
    m_Localized: A potent disinfectant used for cleaning wounds and surfaces. Highly toxic if ingested, but that doesn't stop it being used as an alternative to Nudka in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425441
    m_Localized: Basic Bandage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425442
    m_Localized: A simple, clean bandage for dressing wounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425443
    m_Localized: Hemostatic Bandage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425444
    m_Localized: A bandage coated with a potent hemostatic agent capable of stopping heavy and light bleeding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425445
    m_Localized: Topical Medication Bandage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425446
    m_Localized: A bandage coated with a mild topical medical gel that aids in the healing process.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425447
    m_Localized: Immunivax Injector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425448
    m_Localized: A high-precision immuno-regulator developed to temporarily suppress the hyper-reactive immune response associated with Sentinel Collapse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425449
    m_Localized: Synaprest Injector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425450
    m_Localized: Next-generation treatment for drug addiction, designed to suppress the brain's reward system, reduce cravings, and support long-term recovery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425451
    m_Localized: Works best with concurrent psychological therapy and social support.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425452
    m_Localized: Oxymore Injector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425453
    m_Localized: Oxymore is a legal, but dangerous medication used to relieve severe pain and produce feelings of euphoria. Oxymore addiction and overdose are widespread due to over-prescription.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425454
    m_Localized: Nomore Injector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425455
    m_Localized: A non-addictive alternative to Oxymore for pain relief. Provides effective analgesia without the risk of dependence or overdose. This one is a prototype packaged in a repurposed injector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425456
    m_Localized: Naloxgone Injector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425457
    m_Localized: Naloxgone is a emergency medication used to counter Oxymore overdose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425458
    m_Localized: Composition Spectrometer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425459
    m_Localized: A device used to analyze the chemical composition of substances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425460
    m_Localized: Glass Shiv
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425461
    m_Localized: A sharp-edged piece of broken glass wrapped in cloth that can be used as a weapon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425462
    m_Localized: Combat Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425463
    m_Localized: A fighting knife designed for military use and primarily intended for hand-to-hand or close combat fighting, but also useful for utility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425464
    m_Localized: Box Cutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425465
    m_Localized: A sturdy utility knife with a retractable blade commonly used in construction, crafting and warehouse work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425466
    m_Localized: Meat Cleaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582828425467
    m_Localized: Kitchen Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619520
    m_Localized: A stainless steel knife. Keep out of reach of children and scheming Upper Levels Housewives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619521
    m_Localized: Combat Machete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619522
    m_Localized: A heavy-duty machete built for combat and survival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619523
    m_Localized: Crowbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619524
    m_Localized: The trusty tool of every experienced scavenger and theoretical physicist on the Station. Useful as a weapon in a pinch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619525
    m_Localized: Hatchet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619526
    m_Localized: Small but sturdy. Can be used on a Hydroponic Farm to clear whatever is currently growing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619527
    m_Localized: Lead Pipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619528
    m_Localized: A heavy lead pipe. After the Station overhauled the water line, tonnes of leftover lead piping found its way into the hands of scavs and thieves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619529
    m_Localized: Stun Baton
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619530
    m_Localized: Standard-issue stun baton with STUN and HARM modes. An everyday carry for Security Officers maintaining order in the station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619531
    m_Localized: Energy Cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619532
    m_Localized: In an effort to reduce waste, single-use batteries were made illegal by the Republic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619533
    m_Localized: A basic power source that is compatible with most machines. Rechargeable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619534
    m_Localized: Energy Cell (Mk. II)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619535
    m_Localized: Improving on the standard model, the Mk. II cell is bigger, better and even more of a choking hazard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619536
    m_Localized: An improved power source that is compatible with most machines. Rechargeable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619537
    m_Localized: Self Charging Energy Cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619538
    m_Localized: An advanced and rare energy cell capable of self charging
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619539
    m_Localized: Glass Shard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619540
    m_Localized: Security Record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619541
    m_Localized: A copy of your security record file from the Security Department
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619542
    m_Localized: Your contact will keep this up to date
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619543
    m_Localized: Flashlight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619544
    m_Localized: A heavy duty flashlight. While carrying this, you are less likely to be injured while scavenging in the Dumping Grounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619545
    m_Localized: Newspaper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619546
    m_Localized: A fresh newspaper.
