  - m_Id: 140582832619735
    m_Localized: Hydroponic Smuggler Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619736
    m_Localized: A module that remove the contrabands status of any growing seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619737
    m_Localized: Hydroreed Filter Hydroponic Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619738
    m_Localized: A Module that allows the stem of a grown Hydroreed to be harvested and used as a water filter. Does not affect other plants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619739
    m_Localized: Fillerweed Production Hydroponic Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619740
    m_Localized: A module will improve yield of Fillerweed at the cost of losing seeds. This module's unique effect doesn't affect other plants. This effect is not stackable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619741
    m_Localized: Dream Cap Nightmare Hydroponic Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619742
    m_Localized: A module that concentrate psychoactive propreties of Dream Cap when farming them, turning them into Nightmare Cap, a toxic variant. This module's unique effect doesn't affect other plants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619743
    m_Localized: Dream Cap Neutralizer Hydroponic Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619744
    m_Localized: A module that neutralize all psychoactive propreties of Dream Cap when farming them, turning them into Meal Cap. This module's unique effect can be stacked but doesn't affect other plants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619745
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit Hydroponic Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619746
    m_Localized: A module by pastel that allow Hydroponic System to yield more Nutrifruit when farming them. This module's unique effect doesn't affect other plants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619747
    m_Localized: Kotton Auto Loom Hydroponic Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619748
    m_Localized: A module that wove the Kotton Fiber into a fabric when farming them. This module's unique effect doesn't affect other plants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619749
    m_Localized: Evaporator Solvent Recovery Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619750
    m_Localized: Metal Printer Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619751
    m_Localized: A module that allows the printer to use metal printer chips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619752
    m_Localized: Alarm Transmitter Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619753
    m_Localized: "Currently Transmitting To: <b>{0}</b> \n Transmitting twice to the same faction has no additional effect."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619754
    m_Localized: This module will transmit security camera footage captured by your cameras to the set faction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619755
    m_Localized: Furnace Module (Blast)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619756
    m_Localized: A special Module that modifies the Furnace, allowing {0} Materials to create {1} Metal Ingots (at slightly lower purity). Does not stack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619757
    m_Localized: Furnace Module (Junk Processing)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619758
    m_Localized: A special Module that modifies the Furnace, allowing Junk to be processed into Scrap Metal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619759
    m_Localized: Module Extractor (Basic)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619760
    m_Localized: Allows you to extract stuck modules from machines without breaking them. Has {0} uses. Can be partially refurbished with Electronic Parts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619761
    m_Localized: Module Extractor (Advanced)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619762
    m_Localized: Allows you to extract stuck modules from machines without breaking them. This advanced model will not degrade with use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619763
    m_Localized: Module Bay Expansion Kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619764
    m_Localized: A one time use kit that will allow you to expand Machine's Module capacity. This kit is not compatible with Chemical or other special Machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619765
    m_Localized: Chemical Equipment Module
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619766
    m_Localized: Require a module extractor to remove once installed. A special module that can improve the Blender, the Heating Plate and the Chem Finisher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582832619767
    m_Localized: A specialized circuit that can provide or receive bonuses from adjacent Modules when installed in certain Machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
