    m_Localized: Kotton Lining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813826
    m_Localized: Kotton fabric made into padding. Provide modest protection to its wearer. Can protect against small arms if multiple layers are stacked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813827
    m_Localized: Designed for workers in hazardous environment. Also an essential piece of equipment for scavs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813828
    m_Localized: Remove Contraband Status of Growing Seeds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813829
    m_Localized: Will only recover Solvent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
