    m_Localized: Produce Kotton Fabric instead of Kotton Fiber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813840
    m_Localized: Pilk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813841
    m_Localized: A carton of processed milk, or rather, a sweet, carbonated 'milk-based' beverage. Tastes better than you'd expect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813842
    m_Localized: Puice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813843
    m_Localized: A carton of processed juice. All the natural sugars have been extracted and replaced with refined sugars. Contains 0.1% real fruit juice!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813844
    m_Localized: Peat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813845
    m_Localized: A can of salty processed meat made by Davre. It is cheap, available and filling. As long as one does not care about what type of meat it is made of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813846
    m_Localized: Hot Sauce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813847
    m_Localized: Bottle of Spring Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813848
    m_Localized: A sealed bottle of water supposedly drawn from a natural spring on a distant planet untouched by any industrial activity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813849
    m_Localized: No one in the Lower Levels would drink this, even if they were dying of thirst, such is its value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813850
    m_Localized: Red Imp Beer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813851
    m_Localized: A popular beer brewed in the Lower Levels. Every batch tastes a bit different, but there is nothing cheaper. 3.5% ABV.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813852
    m_Localized: Empty Beer Bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813853
    m_Localized: Not a drop left. To prevent waste, brewers typically offer some kind of "buyback" program for their bottles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813854
    m_Localized: Bottle of Water (Standard)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813855
    m_Localized: Bottle of Water (Small)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813856
    m_Localized: Bottle of Water (Micro)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813857
    m_Localized: Bottle of Acidic Solution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813858
    m_Localized: 'Warning: Corrosive. Handle with care.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813859
    m_Localized: Can be used to clump Protein and Stabilizing Agent for easier filtering. Also counteracts bases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813860
    m_Localized: Bottle of Basic Solution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813861
    m_Localized: 'Warning: Caustic. Handle with care.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813862
    m_Localized: Can be used to clump Protein and Stabilizing Agent for easier filtering. Also counteracts acid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813863
    m_Localized: Bottle of N-Methylol Base
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813864
    m_Localized: A versatile chemical base used in many legitimate chemical manufacturing but also a common precursor for Phanta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813865
    m_Localized: Bottle of Reducing Agent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813866
    m_Localized: Donates electrons to another substance, changing the other substance's chemical state.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813867
    m_Localized: Essential for certain chemical reaction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813868
    m_Localized: Bottle of Lipobond Agent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813869
    m_Localized: Clump Oils and Fat together allowing them to be filtered off easily. This agent can then be evaporate off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813870
    m_Localized: 1ml Dropper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813871
    m_Localized: A high-precision dropper for dispensing small amount of liquid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813872
    m_Localized: 5ml Dropper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
