    m_Localized: 100ml Graduated Cylinder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813876
    m_Localized: Bottle of Water (Large)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813877
    m_Localized: Jug of Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813878
    m_Localized: Soda
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813879
    m_Localized: A sweet carbonated beverage. On some parts of the Station, it's cheaper than clean water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813880
    m_Localized: Energy Drink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813881
    m_Localized: Nudka
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813882
    m_Localized: A strong spirit made from Nutrifruit. Originally developed to be a heavy-duty paint stripper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813883
    m_Localized: Galaxy Blend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813884
    m_Localized: A nutritious puree made from pastel Inc.'s Nutrifruit and fortified with additional vitamins and minerals. One of the healthiest, and least popular foods available in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813885
    m_Localized: Cat Chocolate Bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813886
    m_Localized: A chocolate-covered wafer bar. Made to share, mostly eaten alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813887
    m_Localized: Li-Eat Snack Bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813888
    m_Localized: A high protein chocolate flavored candy bar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813889
    m_Localized: Raw Meat (Small)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813890
    m_Localized: A small piece of raw meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813891
    m_Localized: Fresh meat is a rare sight in the Lower Levels, where it comes from is of little interest to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813892
    m_Localized: Raw Meat (Standard)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813893
    m_Localized: A piece of raw meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813894
    m_Localized: Fresh meat is a rare sight in the Lower Levels, where it comes from is of little interest to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813895
    m_Localized: Animal Fat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813896
    m_Localized: A pound of suet. Cheap, and commonly used for rendering into tallow, or adding flavor to broths.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813897
    m_Localized: Offal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813898
    m_Localized: Organs, entrails, cartilage and trimming. While comestible and nutritious, is considered undesirable by most cuisines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813899
    m_Localized: Instant Ramen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813900
    m_Localized: Contains a single use, flameless heater. Just add water for cooking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813901
    m_Localized: Artificial Braised Beef Flavored. A certified Lower Levels classic. MSG, white pepper and Sichuan peppercorns give this instant noodle a spicy kick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813902
    m_Localized: Sealed Water Ration (Standard)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813903
    m_Localized: Can be poured into a liquid container for 750ml of Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813904
    m_Localized: Sealed Water Ration (Small)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140582836813905
    m_Localized: Can be poured into a liquid container for 375ml of Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 158976881508352
    m_Localized: '"Ancient Alien Relics"'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 158979263873024
    m_Localized: 100% Pure Dehydrated Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 158981042257920
    m_Localized: Scav's journal entry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159203780771840
    m_Localized: Looks like scrap metal... "Ancient Alien" scrap metal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 159205794037760
    m_Localized: '   Here I am, deep in the Abandoned Sections. Everywhere else on the station has been picked clean, but this place... it''s different. I''ve heard the stories, but so far, the loot''s been good. Still, there''s an eerie weight in the air, like something unseen is lurking just out of sight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772018733056
    m_Localized: Alarm System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510272
    m_Localized: A smart security alarm system, equipped with a suite of sensors and connects to cameras installed by the previous owner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510273
    m_Localized: Greatly reduces the chance of theft during the night. Requires a dedicated power source to function.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510274
    m_Localized: Alarm Instruction Manual
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510275
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Prevention Rate Bonus\n  Quality: No Effect"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510276
    m_Localized: Blender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510277
    m_Localized: A flimsy looking blender
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510278
    m_Localized: Chem Finisher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510279
    m_Localized: Package chemicals into pills, vials and other containers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510280
    m_Localized: Cryptographic Desequencer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510281
    m_Localized: Can be used to write various permissions to Blank Keycards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510282
    m_Localized: Requires a Desequencer Chip and an Access Keycard. Requires Energy. Overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510283
    m_Localized: Modified Access Card
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510284
    m_Localized: 'How To: The Desequencer'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510285
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Speed\n  Quality: No Effect\nInsert a Desequencer Chip, and an Access Keycard. Requires Energy. Overnight."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510286
    m_Localized: Evaporator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510287
    m_Localized: A slow machine that works overnight to evaporate liquids out of a solution using low heat and dry air.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510288
    m_Localized: Evaporator Instruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510289
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Volume Evaporate Per Night\n  Quality: Volume of Vapor Captured\nWorks overnight when power and a water container are provided."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510290
    m_Localized: Furnace
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510291
    m_Localized: Refines 2 pieces of either metal scrap or ores into a metal ingot. Requires Energy. Overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510292
    m_Localized: 'How To: The Furnace'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510293
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: No Effect\n  Quality: Maximum Purity"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510294
    m_Localized: Insert (2) Metal Ore or Scrap Metal to produce (1) Metal Ingot. The quality of the ingot is determined by the purity of the materials used. Using ore results in a higher purity than scrap. Overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510295
    m_Localized: Heating Plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510296
    m_Localized: A shabby looking underpowered and inaccurate heating plate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510297
    m_Localized: Bottle Printer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510298
    m_Localized: A pre-programmed 3D printer that is capable of creating small Water Bottles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510299
    m_Localized: Cassette Player
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510300
    m_Localized: Recharger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510301
    m_Localized: A device for recharging Energy Cell. Will slowly recharge an Energy Cell as long as the power service has been paid. Overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510302
    m_Localized: Mirage Projector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510303
    m_Localized: A sophisticated device that emits captivating holographic projections, making your Store more attractive to customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510304
    m_Localized: Requires a night to charge, but improves the street attractiveness of your Store on the next day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510305
    m_Localized: 'How To: The Projector'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510306
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance (0.25 Ratio): Attractiveness\n  Quality (0.5 Ratio): Attractiveness"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510307
    m_Localized: 3D Printer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510308
    m_Localized: A machine that can print various items using plastic. Works overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510309
    m_Localized: 3D Printer Instruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510310
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Printer Speed Rate\n  Quality (0.25 Ratio): Print Quality On Eligible Items"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510311
    m_Localized: Insert power source, printer chip and materials. Printer will work automatically overnight if requirements are met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510312
    m_Localized: Hydroponic System
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510313
    m_Localized: A compact hydroponic system. Requires a dedicated power source to function. Works overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510314
    m_Localized: Hydroponic Instruction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510315
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance  (0.5 Ratio): Growth Rate\n  Quality (0.5 Ratio): Max Yield %"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510316
    m_Localized: Insert a water container with the cleanest water you can get, a seed, and a power source with enough energy. The hydroponic works overnight. This machine can accept optional modules to improve its capabilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510317
    m_Localized: Moisture Farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510318
    m_Localized: A machine designed to extract Water from the humid ambient air of the Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510319
    m_Localized: Produces Water when provided with a container. Requires Energy. Overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510320
    m_Localized: 'How To: The Moisture Farm'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510321
    m_Localized: This machine produces Water by harvesting it from the atmosphere, and deposits it into a provided container. Requires a power source with enough energy. This is an overnight process. This machine can be improved with Modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510322
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Volume Produced\n  Quality: Purity"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510323
    m_Localized: Water Purifier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510324
    m_Localized: A machine that uses reverse osmosis to purify Water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510325
    m_Localized: Purifies the contents of an inserted Water container. Requires Energy. Overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510326
    m_Localized: Water Purifier Instructions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510327
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Amount Removed Per Night\n  Quality (0.5 Ratio): Maximum Purity"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510328
    m_Localized: This machine purifies Water inside a provided container. Significantly more effective for highly contaminated Water. Requires a power source with enough energy. This is an overnight process. This machine can be improved with Modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510329
    m_Localized: Vending Machine Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510330
    m_Localized: Vending Machine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510331
    m_Localized: A vending machine that sells items automatically overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510332
    m_Localized: Items will be sold at +10% additional value and with Retail Markup if applicable but is not affected by event related modifiers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510333
    m_Localized: Vending Fountain Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510334
    m_Localized: Vending Fountain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510335
    m_Localized: A vending water fountain machine that sells water automatically overnight. Only Basewater, High Quality Water and Pure Water can be sold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 412772035510336
    m_Localized: Items will be sold at +10% additional value and with Retail Markup if applicable but is not affected by event related modifiers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1241747959889920
    m_Localized: Water Testing Strip (Used)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1241747976667136
    m_Localized: A used water quality testing strip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594865029120
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806336
    m_Localized: Created by pastel Inc., the Nutrifruit is a highly modified tuber that is resistant to pests and diseases. It is cheap, has a high yield and is easy to grow, extremely nutritious, but purposefully seedless.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806337
    m_Localized: Kotton Fiber
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806338
    m_Localized: A modified variant of traditional Cotton. Can be woven into highly durable and versatile fabric
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806339
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit Seed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806340
    m_Localized: A tuber, genetically modified to be hardy and fast growing. Requires nutrients and water to grow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806341
    m_Localized: Kotton Seed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806342
    m_Localized: A hard to grow seed that can be planted to grow more Kotton Fiber. It is a modified Cotton that can be woven into a durable fabric.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806343
    m_Localized: Dream Cap Spores
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806344
    m_Localized: Coffee Beans
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806345
    m_Localized: A handful of coffee beans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806346
    m_Localized: Dream Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806347
    m_Localized: Cause a slight euphoria and stomach pain when consumed. A key ingredient in Dream Dust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806348
    m_Localized: Nightmare Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806349
    m_Localized: Highly poisonous variant of the common Dream Cap. Can be processed into a deadly poison. Survivors report having horrible hallucinations after ingesting it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806350
    m_Localized: Plant Analyzer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806351
    m_Localized: A specialized tool that can be used to analyse the growth of plants. It can be used to determine the optimal growing conditions for a plant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806352
    m_Localized: Fillerweed Seed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806353
    m_Localized: A beginner-friendly, fast-growing seed that is not affected by nutrient or water quality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806354
    m_Localized: Fillerweed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806355
    m_Localized: A fast-growing, yellowish leafy crop cultivated primarily in the Lower Levels. Offers almost no nutritional value, it is used as a filler in meals to stretch rations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806356
    m_Localized: Has a mushy texture with a slightly bitter aftertaste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806357
    m_Localized: Hydroreed Seed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1420594881806358
    m_Localized: A utility crops that produce no food. The Hydroreed will purify the water it is in while growing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6113839712878592
    m_Localized: Metal Screws
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073686130688
    m_Localized: Processed Cheese
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490816
    m_Localized: Holes are drilled into the cheese for the classic look, whilst also cutting production costs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490817
    m_Localized: Cleaner Robot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490818
    m_Localized: Automatically collects Animal Feces from its surroundings during the night. Can also be activated manually for an immediate cleanup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490819
    m_Localized: Animal Feces (Small)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490820
    m_Localized: Animal Feces
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490821
    m_Localized: Rat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490822
    m_Localized: This serum will slightly boost an animal's growth rate, but at the cost of increased hunger and reduced immunity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10266073715490823
    m_Localized: This serum will slightly boost an animal's immunity but at the cost of increased hunger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
