    m_Localized: Livestock Feed Dispenser
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13006343699742720
    m_Localized: A machine that blends food into stored calories for livestock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16446070918529024
    m_Localized: Aug Scanner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16446070939500544
    m_Localized: An energy hungry electromagnetic field detector fine tuned to pick up on the unique signatures of the Augmentation chip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16446070939500545
    m_Localized: Used to confirm the presence of a suspected Aug with 100% accuracy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16446070939500546
    m_Localized: Surgery Toolset
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16446070939500547
    m_Localized: A set of high quality surgery tools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21347726051295232
    m_Localized: Gene Scanner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21347726118404096
    m_Localized: Can be toggled on to reveal the full genetic makeup of an animal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27515960660115456
