    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27515960681086980
    m_Localized: Luxury Item Neon Sign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27515960681086981
    m_Localized: Material Neon Sign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27515960681086982
    m_Localized: Place it in the display case to attract customer that will sell {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28624308168081408
    m_Localized: Fanny Pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28624308205830144
    m_Localized: Mouse Trap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28624308205830145
    m_Localized: Putting some cheese inside will probably help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36943149553991680
    m_Localized: A guide for determining the appropriate value of cybernetic hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36943149583351808
    m_Localized: Cybernetic Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36943149583351809
    m_Localized: A marvel of biomechanical engineering, designed to mirror the form and function of the hand it replaces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36961915897692160
    m_Localized: AgeWell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36961915897692161
    m_Localized: Accelerates the aging process of certain items inside. Ages items such as Wine and Cheese by an extra day each cycle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36961915897692162
    m_Localized: AgeWell Instructions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36961915897692163
    m_Localized: "[Module Impact]: \n  Efficiency: Power Consumption\n  Performance: Power Consumption\n  Quality: +1 Day age per 125 Quality\nWorks overnight when power and a finished bottle of wine are provided."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36961915897692164
    m_Localized: BloomBerry Wine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36961915897692165
    m_Localized: A popular alcoholic beverage in both the Upper and Lower Levels. Coaxing a fine vintage out of humble BloomBerries is considered an art.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174904340480
    m_Localized: Yeast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506304
    m_Localized: A versatile yeast culture with countless uses, from leavening bread to brewing. For winemaking, it speeds up fermentation and improves the quality of the brew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506305
    m_Localized: Super Yeast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506306
    m_Localized: A highly potent, all-purpose yeast culture prized across countless crafts. For winemaking, it dramatically speeds up the fermentation process.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506307
    m_Localized: Yeast Bioreactor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506308
    m_Localized: An infinite source of yeast. Will be returned to inventory when fermentation starts instead of being consumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506309
    m_Localized: A self-sustaining culture vat that continuously regrows its own yeast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506310
    m_Localized: Wine Bottle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506311
    m_Localized: A fancy glass bottle used for fermenting wine. This one has a integrated airlock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506312
    m_Localized: BloomBerry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506313
    m_Localized: A sweet berry modified for hydroponic growth. While not particularly filling, it's one of few fruits that is accessible in the Lower Levels. Good for making wine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36981174929506314
    m_Localized: BloomBerry Wine Fermenting Guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38118528243253248
    m_Localized: GloomBerry Wine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38118528243253249
    m_Localized: Looks like a Homebrew BloomBerry wine but this one is cheap and mildly carcinogenic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38118528243253250
    m_Localized: Synthetic Yeast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38118528243253251
    m_Localized: An illegal substance that can be used instead of yeast to cheaply produce mildly carcinogenic wine. Requires only water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43225662026989568
    m_Localized: A sealed and certified ration of Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43225662052155392
    m_Localized: A sealed and certified ration of Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43225662056349696
    m_Localized: Bloomberry Seed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43225662056349697
    m_Localized: A perennial bush. It doesn't die after fruiting. Keep its water clean for better bloomberries. Use a hatchet on the planter to clear it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43892318361403392
    m_Localized: Advanced Water Filter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43892318390763520
    m_Localized: Will recover 50 durability at the start of each day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43892318390763521
    m_Localized: A premium water filter for pitchers used in the Upper Levels. Slowly self-cleans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43892318390763522
    m_Localized: HydraTech Micro Water Purifier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43892318390763523
    m_Localized: Use on a water container to bring its contents up to Basewater purity, whatever's in it. It will use 1 durability per 100ml.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43892318390763524
    m_Localized: A disposable advanced water purifier, common in the Upper Levels. The discarded ones wash up in the Dumping Grounds, still good for a few more pours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48314651641692160
    m_Localized: Black Lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48314651650080768
    m_Localized: When placed in the display case, it signals thieves that this shop fences stolen goods. Your Black Market reputation affects how likely they are to respond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48627545411469312
    m_Localized: Meal Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48627545453412352
    m_Localized: A neutralized Dream Cap with no psychoactive properties. Legal and safe to eat. Cannot be processed into Dream Dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62698507987632128
    m_Localized: Skinning Knife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62698508025380864
    m_Localized: The perfect knife for a veteran rancher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62698508025380865
    m_Localized: Animal Feces (Large)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64126146879209472
    m_Localized: Toolbox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64126146925346816
    m_Localized: Holds tools. Press 1-9 on the keyboard to equip the stored item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64126146925346817
    m_Localized: Quite robust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69880199391264768
    m_Localized: Fridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69880199416430592
    m_Localized: Chills stored drinks overnight. Chilled goods sell for more. Wine and unsealed water are unaffected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69880199416430593
    m_Localized: Bei's Premium Vanilla Icecream
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69880199416430594
    m_Localized: A delicious treat that is legally categorized as Artificially Flavored Frozen Dairy Product. Somehow it doesn't melt when unrefrigerated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69880199416430595
    m_Localized: Can be sold at a higher value when frozen overnight in the fridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73574298531184640
    m_Localized: Water Pitcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 73574298564739072
    m_Localized: Holds a water filter to strip some contaminants from the water poured through it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
