  - m_Id: 79460289510948876
    m_Localized: Gutter Tilapia Fry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79460289510948877
    m_Localized: Graft Tilapia Fry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79460289510948878
    m_Localized: Graft tilapia eggs. Thick with the repair protein that makes the skin heal, which is why medics buy them by the clutch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79460289510948879
    m_Localized: Tilapia Skin Graft
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 79460289510948880
    m_Localized: Sterilized skin of a graft tilapia. Stops the bleeding and closes a wound.
    m_Metadata:
