  - m_Id: 84579801482706944
    m_Localized: Pile of Debris
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84579801512067072
    m_Localized: You will spend some time clearing the debris whenever you sleep without going out of the Store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84579801512067073
    m_Localized: You will need tools to clear this one. Each tool used on it will be destroyed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84579801512067074
    m_Localized: Far too heavy to move yourself. The Debris Removal nightly service will be needed to clear it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84579801512067075
    m_Localized: Makeshift Micro Nuclear Reactor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84579801512067076
    m_Localized: Powers the Store while its integrity is above {0}. Loses integrity every night and explodes at 0. Scrap metal restores {1} integrity. Junk restores {2} integrity but lowers maximum integrity by {3}. Each common electronic part reduces the nightly loss by 1.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85667997352247296
    m_Localized: Appraisal Board Certificate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85667997381607424
