  - m_Id: 87029687331373056
    m_Localized: Firearm Neon Sign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87029687343955968
    m_Localized: Heavy Firearm Neon Sign
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87133274678018048
    m_Localized: Current Converter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87133274715766784
    m_Localized: Draw power directly from the Lower Levels' grid to power any machine instead of a battery. The Current Converter nightly service must be paid in order to receive power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056494051328
    m_Localized: Li Bei Wen's Nomore Formula
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411456
    m_Localized: Armed Plastic Explosive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411457
    m_Localized: This is what Lou planted. According to the timer, it will explode at midnight. You'd better disarm it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411458
    m_Localized: Fake Plastic Explosive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411459
    m_Localized: This is the bomb Lou planted, but it looks like there's no actual payload inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411460
    m_Localized: Old Republic Orders
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411461
    m_Localized: A yellowed, brittle sheet. It looks like it has been folded and unfolded many times. It's a written order addressed to Lou, dated years ago. A faded Republic seal is still visible at the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411462
    m_Localized: "REPUBLIC JOINT SPECIAL OPERATIONS COMMAND, PRIORITY ORDER\nTO: Emergency Response Team Leader Lou\n\nStop stalling for time and carry out this order immediately. Take your team and start the self-destruct sequence of the research ship Icarus. Disable all the escape pods and do not allow any survivor from the Icarus to escape with your team. Do it, or I will have you court-martialed.\n\n(The signature has faded beyond reading.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411463
    m_Localized: Lou's Box of Toys
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87855056523411464
    m_Localized: Looks like a repurposed evidence locker from the Security Department. Better not touch anything inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87889430937649152
    m_Localized: Liquid Luck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87889430937649153
    m_Localized: Will 100% increase your luck for 3 days! Georgio's guarantee! It tastes like Rustwater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87889430937649154
    m_Localized: Kid's Backpack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87889430937649155
    m_Localized: Kid's Backpack (Large)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88109785493061632
    m_Localized: Improved Internal Springs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88109785530810368
    m_Localized: A set of sturdier internal springs that help the action cycle reliably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88109785530810369
    m_Localized: 3D Printer Chip (x{0} Improved Internal Springs)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88262004867645440
    m_Localized: Gambler's Coin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88262004905394176
    m_Localized: A coin from a currency nobody remembers. They say it brings luck. Mostly, it scratches tickets faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245508415488
    m_Localized: Care Package for Eleanor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245529387008
    m_Localized: 'A sealed crate of fine goods from the Upper Levels. Whoever packed it spared no expense. Strange, though: your Security feed lists it as reported stolen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245529387009
    m_Localized: SYNC Self-Refilling Neuroactive Perfume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245529387010
    m_Localized: Use to boost trading bonus by 15% with the current customer. You can only benefit from the effects of one perfume at a time. Refills on its own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245529387011
    m_Localized: The premium edition of the SYNC perfume. A sealed reservoir in the cap slowly synthesizes a new dose, so the bottle never quite runs dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245529387012
    m_Localized: Storage Bay Expansion Kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88474245529387013
    m_Localized: Use it on a Storage Bay to add two storage tabs, or on an Extended Storage Bay to add one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798324109312
    m_Localized: Storage Coordinator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275136
    m_Localized: Assign containers and machines to presets. Give each preset a hotkey to open them quickly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275137
    m_Localized: Electronic Parts (Hypertech)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275138
    m_Localized: The bleeding edge of electronics. Nobody on the station can make these.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275139
    m_Localized: Used to upgrade or charge certain Hypertech items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275140
    m_Localized: Hypertech Power Cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275141
    m_Localized: An experimental cell with no stored charge. It powers any machine whose draw stays within the cell's output rating, indefinitely. Machines that draw more than the rating get nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275142
    m_Localized: Hypertech Turbo Booster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275143
    m_Localized: A turbo booster powered by an Energy Cell. It charges every cycle and banks spare charge. Once charged, it instantly completes a machine's current cycle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275144
    m_Localized: Hypertech Storage Bay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275145
    m_Localized: Mind Reprogrammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88777798349275146
    m_Localized: Can remove and add certain perks. Consume Electronic Parts (Hypertech) to charge it. The device needs time to reset after each use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88855356914843648
    m_Localized: Auto Butcher
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88855356927426560
    m_Localized: A configurable auto butcher. It needs to be installed inside an Animal Cage or a RAS. Every night it harvests the animals that match its settings into its tray. It always ignores animals marked with the Marking Pen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88855356927426561
    m_Localized: The mighty Gibber. Do not climb inside. Do not let anyone help you climb inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88855356927426562
    m_Localized: Marking Pen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88855356927426563
    m_Localized: Marks an animal or a fish with a colour. The Auto Butcher never touches a marked animal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88937259386847232
    m_Localized: Intake Hopper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88937259420401664
    m_Localized: Can be linked to an Outlet Hopper and configured to send the items of its inventory into the Outlet Hopper's inventory every night. Use it on an Outlet Hopper to link them, double-click to set it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88937259420401665
    m_Localized: Outlet Hopper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88937259420401666
    m_Localized: Receives the items sent by its linked Intake Hoppers into its inventory every night. Use it on an Intake Hopper to link them, double-click to run them now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89249160964653056
    m_Localized: Disposable Battery
